+// (orthros_fd_read_async, orthros_fd_sync_async, Emscripten's emscripten_sleep — through engine.cpp's --wrap'd C
+// library functions —, present, breathe, settle, gl_settle, read_wait) only when orthros_jspi_may() says so (under a
+// promising export, not suspended), the plain ones otherwise (fd_read, fd_sync: as a build without JSPI).
